  "conclusions": {
    "typed_connection_forwarding": "Confirmed inconsistency in this pinned revision: typed config is accepted and used by the native Pydantic AI provider, while OGX synthesis ignores it and reads only legacy extra/api_key_env. This is not an unknown-field input error. Runtime service/model effects are established separately from this isolated probe.",
    "documented_workaround": "Keep typed connection settings for the native provider and duplicate the OGX inference provider connection in the documented native_override. The deprecated extra escape hatch also forwards to OGX, but is not the preferred new setup.",
    "models_override": "An explicit registered_resources.models list under native_override replaces auto-registered models. The empty override causing loss of fixture-model was experiment configuration error, not a product bug."
